WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
All right, Summit Strategist.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Let's work through the beginning

3
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.200
of a possible solution.

4
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.879
First, send Scout and Navigator across together.

5
00:00:08.879 --> 00:00:11.680
Then have Scout bring the beacon back.

6
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.880
Now send Builder and Mentor across together.

7
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.080
You've moved your two slowest teammates to safety, and

8
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.280
Navigator is already waiting at the signal station.

9
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.040
But Scout is still on the starting

10
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.040
side, and the beacon needs to return.

11
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.040
Who should bring it back so the

12
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.600
final two teammates can cross together?

13
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.164
You're closer than you think!